{"text": "Then someone in the crowd called out, I think it is General Zhigalovs dog. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> General Zhigalovs, Hmm, Yeldyrin, help me off with my coat, for it is terribly hot today. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But one thing I cannot understand is how it could ever reach your finger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is such a little dog, and you are such a big, tall man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You must have scratched your finger on a nail, and then you got the idea of asking for money. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I know you people very well, you rascals. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He pushed a lit cigarette into her face as a joke, sir, and she was clever enough to snap at him, said another man in the crowd. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That is a lie, cried Khryukin, His honor is a wise man who knows who is lying and who is telling the truth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And let me tell you, my own brother is in the police too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Stop arguing, both of you, Ochumelov ordered sharply.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "o", "n", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "r", "o", "w", "d", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "o", "u", "t", ",", " ", "I", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", "k", " ", "i", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "G", "e", "n", "e", "r", "a", "l", " ", "Z", "h", "i", "g", "a", "l", "o", "v", "s", " ", "d", "o", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "G", "e", "n", "e", "r", "a", "l", " ", "Z", "h", "i", "g", "a", "l", "o", "v", "s", ",", " ", "H", "m", "m", ",", " ", "Y", "e", "l", "d", "y", "r", "i", "n", ",", " ", "h", "e", "l", "p", " ", "m", "e", " ", "o", "f", "f", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "m", "y", " ", "c", "o", "a", "t", ",", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "i", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "t", "e", "r", "r", "i", "b", "l", "y", " ", "h", "o", "t", " ", "t", "o", "d", "a", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a"